Polls website implemented: server.py (Python standard library, SQLite in DATA_DIR/polls.db), setup.sh, run.sh. Pages: Home, All Polls, Poll voting form (one vote per browser per poll via cookie), Results (per poll with bars) and an overall Results list. Sample polls and votes are seeded when the database is empty. Verified: all routes return 200/404 as expected, vote is recorded and shown, invalid submit shows error, fresh start with empty DATA_DIR works.
